# The 5-state busy beaver (the pack is packs/turing) drawn as its history: a
# row a sweep of the head, the cells it wrote that sweep coloured by the
# state that wrote them, older ones white, zeros dark. Its first 10 000 steps
# fill about 185 x 174 cells, mostly to the left of where it starts.
#
#   make run ARGS="play saves/turing --scenario scenarios/turing.scenario"
#
# It takes two ticks a step and one more a sweep: 10 000 steps are about
# 20 200 ticks, 42 minutes at 1x and under 3 at 16x.
rules ../packs/turing
seed 1
size 256 256
terrain water_level 0 rock_on_soil 0 rock_on_water 0    # all soil: the blank tape
start head at (220, 1)
